---
title: Piadina
description: The piadina Romagnola flatbread is the apex of Italian street food. Ridiculously easy to make from scratch, it goes perfectly with a filling of pistachio pesto, mortadella, and stracchino (my favourite combo), or the classic prosciutto crudo, squacquerone, and rocket.
category: More
cuisine: Italian
tags:
  - Italian
